    "source": "EU Omnibus Directive 2019/2161 Art. 6a of 98/6/EC: prior price = lowest price in ≥30 days before the reduction (https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2019/2161/oj); confirmed by CJEU C-330/23 (https://globallitigationnews.bakermckenzie.com/2024/10/15/european-union-the-cjeu-confirms-that-a-price-reduction-must-be-calculated-based-on-the-lowest-price-in-the-last-30-days/). Thresholds are assumptions adapted to MRP-based listings."
